>> Combination := Papa hou.

Combination i: ['pākuʻi-hope:'] hana: { :el
	iho 
	huli: el, ʻOle? ʻoiaʻiʻo: { iho pākuʻi-hope: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination hou.
colours
	pākuʻi-hope: ['red'],
	pākuʻi-hope: ['green'],
	pākuʻi-hope: ['blue'],
	pākuʻi-hope: ['red'].

Huapuka kākau: colours, laina-hou.
